//! The GBurn window: menu bar, tool bar (left), the design canvas (the machine bed, mm, Y up), the Cuts / Layers and
//! Laser panels (right) and a status bar. Every edit is one undo step; a recovery copy is written 3 s after a change.
//! Safety: the beam only comes on through the Laser panel's Start; Frame moves with it off; Stop is always on screen.

